# QA DoD-3 / ROB-1: start on a corrupt profile.ron + settings.ron + a broken Toy Town ghost
# (prepared by corrupt.sh): the toast must show, defaults are used, the bad files are kept as
# *.corrupt-<unix s>; a Time Trial on Toy Town must start without the broken ghost.
wait ui
0.3 shot cor_01_ui_ready
1.0 shot cor_02_1s
2.0 shot cor_03_3s
1.0 nav keyboardA confirm          # Title
1.5 shot cor_04_main
0.3 nav keyboardA down
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Time Trial
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
2.0 nav keyboardA up
0.3 nav keyboardA left
0.3 nav keyboardA left             # Toy Town
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
2.0 nav keyboardA confirm          # race
wait countdown
1.0 shot cor_05_tt_countdown
wait racing
0.5 tap keyboardA pause
wait paused
0.3 nav keyboardA down
0.3 nav keyboardA down
0.3 nav keyboardA down
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Quit race
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
0.4 nav keyboardA left
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
wait menu
1.0 exit
